### 📌 Backend Checklist
- <input type="checkbox"> **Database & Models**
  - <input type="checkbox"> Ensure all TypeORM models are correctly structured.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Use migrations and seeders for database consistency.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Optimize indexes and relations for better query performance.

- <input type="checkbox"> **API Structure & Optimization**
  - <input type="checkbox"> Move business logic to services (controllers should only handle requests).
  - <input type="checkbox"> Implement proper error handling (Try/Catch, Middleware).
  - <input type="checkbox"> Validate API requests using Joi/Zod/Yup.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Optimize database queries to avoid unnecessary calls.

- <input type="checkbox"> **Authentication & Security**
  - <input type="checkbox"> Hash passwords before storing in the database.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Implement rate limiting to prevent brute-force attacks.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Use refresh tokens for better authentication flow.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Ensure CORS is properly configured.

- <input type="checkbox"> **WebSockets (Real-time Features)**
  - <input type="checkbox"> Implement real-time notifications using Socket.io.
  - <input type="checkbox"> Optimize Socket connections (disconnect when unused).
  - <input type="checkbox"> Ensure the chat sidebar updates in real-time.
